?","tab_content":"<p>Elige el plan de membres\u00eda que quieres adquirir, en el carrito selecciona \u2018Tengo un cup\u00f3n\u2019, ingr\u00e9salo y el monto cambiar\u00e1 a $0.00.<\/p>","_id":"5113bb9"},{"tab_title":" \u00bfCu\u00e1nto dura cada curso?","tab_content":"<p>Cada curso dura aproximadamente 40 minutos, divididos en m\u00f3dulos pr\u00e1cticos y \u00e1giles de 5-10 minutos cada uno.<\/p>","_id":"4352825"},{"tab_title":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 hago si tengo problemas para ingresar o navegar la plataforma?","tab_content":"<p>Te acompa\u00f1amos en cada paso. Puedes escribirnos a nuestro canal de soporte: nonprofitacademy@wepropel.org<\/p>","_id":"ae43ff4"}],"__globals__":{"tab_active_color":"globals\/colors?id=b49374f","title_typography_typography":"","content_color":"globals\/colors?id=b49374f","content_typography_typography":"","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=b49374f"},"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-chevron-down","library":"fa-solid"},"selected_active_icon":{"value":"fas fa-angle-up","library":"fa-solid"},"title_color":"#F2F2F2","tab_active_color":"#F2F2F2","title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_family":"Libre Franklin","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_weight":"500","title_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"25","right":"0","bottom":"25","left":"0","isLinked":false},"icon_align":"right","content_color":"#F2F2F2","content_typography_typography":"custom","content_typography_font_family":"Libre Franklin","content_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"content_typography_font_weight":"300","content_shadow_text_shadow_type":"yes","_border_border":"none","custom_css":".elementor-accordion .elementor-accordion-item\r\n {\r\n     border:0 !important;\r\n         border-top: 1px solid #d5d8dc;\r\n     \r\n}\r\n\r\n.elementor-accordion .elementor-tab-title {\r\n     border-bottom: 1px solid #d5d8dc;\r\n    \r\n}\r\n\r\n","_background_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_backgroun